  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee Washing Station Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee, Beneficiaries: 51 (16 women), Description: The cooperative seeks to increase its capacity to collect and process coffee cherries to green coffee though improved infrastructures for drying and storing, improved working capital to be able to collect more coffee cherries at favorable (official) terms to benefit the farmers and the cooperative.</narrative>
  </description>
